[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0010","text":"哇、哇啊……\n说是后台，这不完全看得见吗……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0020","text":"啊哈～，舞台就是那个～？\n红白幕布～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0030","text":"──音响也不太行吧\n刚才那个歌手的彩排，只听得见人声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0050","text":"呵呵\n紧张了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0060","text":"才、才没有……！\n今天，没问题……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0070","text":"嘿、嘿嘿！\n毕竟只有我能完美地又唱又跳嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0080","text":"我不加把劲可才行！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0090","text":"拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0100","text":"大家晚上好──\n我们是noctchill"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0110","text":"哇～～～！\n根本没人看～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0120","text":"声音……彻底输给了烟花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0130","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0140","text":"嗯—，我们要唱歌了\n请听"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0150","text":"呵呵呵\n来吧，上吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0160","text":"嗯……！／好～／（叹气）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0170","text":"没关系的\n今天──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0180","text":"我们觉得好的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_06_0005","text":"Motion"}]
